ct and scene composition within the track design. A tight, enclosed urban corridor with close-proximity elements will be incorporated for a more dynamic feel. This section will feature specific camera angles, effects, and frame rates to amplify the sense of speed and immersion. Enhancements to the rendering pipeline, specifically activating ray tracing, are proposed to achieve a wet, reflective asphalt surface.\n\n\nVisual design emphasizes high-contrast lighting and stylized effects. The scene aims for a distinctive look with colored rim lighting, volumetric light rays, and a stylized moon/portal element. Incorporating dynamic action FX with exhaust effects, sparks, and stylized visual elements will enhance the scene's impact.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"swarm","args":{"action":"\"title\"","title":"\"V6 Ultra：3D 立体纵横都会赛道 × 蜘蛛侠纵横宇宙大片级重制\""}},{"name":"swarm","args":{"action":"\"add\"","brief":"\"You are the 3D Circuit Geometry & Vehicle Physics Architect (`track`) for `D:\\\\项目session\\\\blender-supercar`.\\n\\nCRITICAL TOOL RULE (#7):\\n- NEVER call `read_file` on any binary/image file (`.png`, `.jpg`, `.blend`, `.mp4`, `.wav`) — media attachments trigger a backend 400 error! Inspect generated plots via Python PIL/NumPy stats only.\\n- Mention discipline: `@name` wakes that agent. Do not CC. Hand off to `@env-2`, `@anim`, and `@sfx` as soon as `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json` is generated and verified!\\n\\nCONTEXT — USER PIVOT FOR 10x VISUAL & CINEMATIC IMPACT:\\nFlat 2D grassland Silverstone lacked elevation, close parallax, and cinematic drama. You own designing a brand-new, closed-loop, physically grounded **3D Elevation + Banked Mega-Circuit** (`Neo-Monaco × Nueva York 2099 Sky-Harbor Circuit`)!\\n\\nOWNERSHIP:\\n- You OWN: `pipeline/v6_build_circuit.py`, `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json`, and `track_data/spiderverse_circuit_map.png` (2D layout + elevation/speed/banking subplot diagnostic chart).\\n- DO NOT TOUCH any V5 files or other `pipeline/v6_*`